From: yanan.he <yanan.he@linux.alibaba.com>
Subject: [PATCH] configure: replace distutils with stdlib sysconfig

Python 3.12 removed distutils (PEP 632); on Python 3.13 the configure
probes that run `from distutils import sysconfig` fail with
ModuleNotFoundError, leaving PYTHON_VERSION / PYTHON_INCLUDES /
PYTHON_SITE_PACKAGES empty so the libxml2 python bindings are silently
not built. That in turn breaks itstool-native do_configure
("Python module libxml2 is needed") and libxml2 do_install_ptest_base
(missing python/tests/Makefile).

Use stdlib equivalents instead:
- sysconfig.get_python_version() -> '%d.%d' % (v.major, v.minor)
  (attribute access only: autoconf/m4 would eat square brackets of [:2])
- sysconfig.get_python_inc()     -> sysconfig.get_config_var('INCLUDEPY')
  (get_path('include') is wrong: it ignores the staged INCLUDEPY that OE
   relocates per recipe-sysroot and returns a bare /usr/include/pythonX.Y)
- get_python_lib(True,False,P)   -> sysconfig.get_path('platlib', vars=...)
  (base/platbase keep the literal ${exec_prefix} for later eval expansion,
   matching distutils semantics)

Upstream-Status: Backport-incompatible [2.9.14 only; >= 2.10 uses AM_PATH_PYTHON + pkg-config]
Signed-off-by: yanan.he <yanan.he@linux.alibaba.com>
---
 configure.ac | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -832,8 +832,8 @@
     fi
     if test "$PYTHON" != ""
     then
-        PYTHON_VERSION=`$PYTHON -c "from distutils import sysconfig; print(sysconfig.get_python_version())"`
-	PYTHON_INCLUDES=`$PYTHON -c "from distutils import sysconfig; print(sysconfig.get_python_inc())"`
+        PYTHON_VERSION=`$PYTHON -c "import sys; v=sys.version_info; print('%d.%d' % (v.major, v.minor))"`
+	PYTHON_INCLUDES=`$PYTHON -c "import sysconfig; print(sysconfig.get_config_var('INCLUDEPY'))"`
 # does not work as it produce a /usr/lib/python path instead of/usr/lib64/python
 #
 #	PYTHON_SITE_PACKAGES=`$PYTHON -c "from distutils import sysconfig; print(sysconfig.get_python_lib())"`
@@ -877,7 +877,7 @@
 	    then
 		PYTHON_SITE_PACKAGES=$with_python/lib/site-packages
 	    else
-		PYTHON_SITE_PACKAGES=$($PYTHON -c 'from distutils import sysconfig; print(sysconfig.get_python_lib(True,False,"${exec_prefix}"))')
+		PYTHON_SITE_PACKAGES=$($PYTHON -c 'import sysconfig; print(sysconfig.get_path("platlib", vars={"base": "${exec_prefix}", "platbase": "${exec_prefix}"}))')
 	    fi
 	fi
     fi
